<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/link-boundaryless" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7126666); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7126666&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038680" alt="Link Boundaryless" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7126666)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/link-boundaryless" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7126666); return false;">Link Boundaryless</a></span></p>
